{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39895","headline":"嘉运 · 徐夤","name":"嘉运","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉运良时两阻修，钓竿蓑笠乐林丘。\n家无寸帛浑闲事，身似浮云且自由。\n庭际鸟啼花旋落，潭心月在水空流。\n晨炊一箸红银粒，忆着长安索米秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}